# Trial account at: https://www.twilio.com (~$15 free credit)
# Dashboard → Account Info → Account SID + Auth Token
# Phone Numbers → Manage → Buy a Twilio phone number
# IMPORTANT: TWILIO_VERIFIED_TO_NUMBER must be verified in your
#            Twilio console under Phone Numbers → Verified Caller IDs
# ------------------------------------------------------------
